From f3a22316a23a95d73b8790df52900728b7fd64fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Max (Muse)" <max@local.prototype>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 01:25:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Content pack: ham radio forum, 4 new time-capsule dates,
 Night Shift adventure, Sports & TV, era-aware world

- Ham radio forum: expand hamnet to 7 sections (packet, rigs, antennas,
  DX, license study, ARRL bulletins, swap), 16 Dec-1988 seed posts,
  weekly on-air nets announced in-forum and in the CB directory.
- Time capsule: 4 new featured dates (Live Aid, Chernobyl, Exxon Valdez,
  Desert Storm) with full archival packs; picker now lists 10.
- Games: new full-length text adventure 'Night Shift: Earth Station'
  (17 rooms, parser, score, persistent high scores) as games menu 7.
- News: new Sports & TV area (NFL late-1988, prime-time TV grid,
  MLB hot stove), session-date aware.
- Era-aware world: forum announcements render per session
  time-capsule date via cis_dynamic.era_forum_bulletins(); CB ambient
  chatter verified session-date aware already.
- Tests: 257 total (69 new), all passing.
